Package: iNEXT.meta
Type: Package
Title: iNterpolation and EXTrapolation with meta-analysis for beta diversity across three dimensions
Version: 1.1.0
Author: Anne Chao [aut, cre], Yu-Ti Lee [aut], Keng-Lei Lin [aut], Po-Yen Chuang [aut]
